# superdrastic-<version>-aarch64.tar.gz. Bump both together. This release ships the package in dsflip/.
# 0.5.0-beta.1-rocknixds.7 is SuperDrastic v0.5.0-beta.1 (the in-game menu) plus
# dsflip/superdrastic-0.5.0-beta.1-rocknixds.7.patch (SuperDrastic branch claude/1-6-prep-work-kwq9lc and two commits
# made on an RG DS Plus, local branch 1.6-freeze-fix): 1.5.13's four
# commits (shader output sizes with ds-fsr at 3x on the RG DS Plus; the Wi-Fi / Nintendo WFC path; its pre-device
